            "tender": {
                "id": "EPP0339",
                "title": "Tree Management Services in the Braintree District",
                "description": "Braintree District Council (the Authority) has awarded 3 contracts to deliver tree management services across its estate. The requirement is intended to ensure the Authority can fulfil its duty of care, manage tree-related risk, and maintain the health and safety of its tree stock.\r\n\r\nThe procurement was conducted as a Further Competition is issued in relation to the YPO 000881 Grounds Maintenance and Associated Services Dynamic Purchasing System (DPS), procured by YPO in compliance with the Public Contracts Regulations 2015.\r\n\r\nThe services includes Emergency/Make Safe, Reactive and Routine / Planned arboricultural works, together with associated support activities, as described in this specification and within Appendix 1.1\r\n\r\nThe contract is divided into three (3) Lots, each representing a defined geographical area within the Braintree district, as follows:\r\n\r\n•\tLot 1 - East of Braintree District\r\n•\tLot 2 - West of Braintree District\r\n•\tLot 3 - South of Braintree District\r\n\r\nTo ensure a fair distribution of work, support market capacity, and maintain service resilience, each Lot will be serviced by a different contractor.",
